function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

[an|] integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int")

fixed quantity means: @intrinsic("fix", quantity)

flex section if condition:
	replacement:
		@intrinsic("if", condition)

to get the specialization at {fixed integer:depth} for value [slot|done]:
	@intrinsic("store", slot, value)
	if @intrinsic("equal", depth, 1):
		@intrinsic("discard", the specialization at 0 for 1.5 done)
	@intrinsic("return", slot)

ignore the specialization at 1 for 2 done
